    "Container GTM-WNBZ8QD version 317: 173 tags, 86 rules, 173 variables (tags/www.googletagmanager.com-gtm-GTM-WNBZ8QD.js resource).",
    "CMP is injected by GTM, not by the page: Cookiebot CMP template tag_id 180 (template#179) fires on gtm.init_consent with serial/cbid 9ff02350-286d-45c0-ae57-9a4a20538f5c (macros[15]), consentModeEnabled true, cdnRegion eu, waitForUpdate 2000, adsDataRedaction dynamic (tags/www.googletagmanager.com-gtm-GTM-WNBZ8QD.js resource.tags[8], rules[4]). So consent.cmp stays disabled in the contract: enabling the GTM route brings Cookiebot back with it.",
    "Consent is Google Consent Mode set by that template inside GTM (no inline default on the pages — martech/consent-mode.json pages 0/9); tags declare additional consent checks ad_storage / analytics_storage / personalization_storage / security_storage, and most vendor tags fire on the dataLayer event cookie_consent_update (rules[0]). GTM itself loads ungated on the source.",
    "Vendor tags fired by GTM (rules[0] unless noted): 6sense j.6sc.co (tag 759), Meta pixel template#263 (tags 8,171,173,184), LinkedIn Insight template#722 (partner ids 8502217,5724865 — tag 293 etc.), Google Ads __awct / __sp / conversion linker, GA4 __googtag + 42 __gaawe events, Marketo Munchkin 353-SAE-487 (tag 28), Siteimprove (tag 54), idio/Episerver _iaq (tag 143), ZoomInfo US-only (tag 174, rules[71]), Azure App Insights (tag 183), Optimizely cdn.optimizely.com/js/22275741750.js (tags 693,953), Microsoft Clarity (tags 932-939). From tags/www.googletagmanager.com-gtm-GTM-WNBZ8QD.js resource.tags.",
    "Rewrite items for the owner: click/selector triggers read the source DOM — body > nav.site-nav (rules 21,22,27,28), footer.site-footer a (29), iehub-nav__item (23), teaser-block__teaser__inner (33), image-block__container (36), react > div > div > ul > li > a (37), div.services-filter li.custom-dropdown__item a (44), div.podcast-sticky-bar a (46), side-button / site-nav__contact-us-button (57,58), related-cases__item-link (65), featured-verticals-block__item__link (66), iehub-offering (64,67), social-sharing__ (14). Custom dataLayer events the new pages must push for parity: Form Submit Marketo, Form Submit, Marketo Form Rendered, view_search_results, popupShow/popupClose/popupOpenLink, video / video:play / video:complete, audio, caseFilterClicked, cta_click, expandable_clicked, content_dwell/content_consumed/content_scroll, optimizely_decision_web, eventDemand, 6si_company_details_loaded; plus dataLayer.pageCategory."
